-The compliance layer treats ITU Radio Regulations Article 9 coordination and Article 22 EPFD limits as hard design constraints (feeder-link masks, gateway exclusion zones), together with applicable PFD/EIRP conditions and national authorisations.
-It supports EU-hosted processing, encryption, key ownership, data minimisation, pseudonymisation and controlled GDPR retention.
